    "description": "According to 5 and Dime general manager and drink creator Cara Mahon, this highball was inspired by two cocktails that went viral: the Negroni Sbagliato and the Spaghett, a mix of Aperol, Miller High Life, and lemon. \"It tastes like a more complex Sbagliato,\" Mahon says. Pasubio stands in for sweet vermouth, while the Cappelletti rounds out the bitterness of the Campari. \"You get a balanced, slightly trashy (in the best way) riff on a riff,\" she adds.",
